4
00:00:13.347 --> 00:00:17.768
Today we learn: Leadership and Teamwork. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.945 --> 00:00:22.829
Leadership. Say it with me. Leadership!

6
00:00:26.329 --> 00:00:29.513
Teamwork. Say it with me. Teamwork!

7
00:00:32.996 --> 00:00:37.063
Collaborate. Say it with me. Collaborate!

8
00:00:40.563 --> 00:00:44.146
Delegate. Say it with me. Delegate!

9
00:00:47.663 --> 00:00:51.830
Initiative. Say it with me. Initiative!

10
00:00:55.322 --> 00:00:59.839
Accountability. Say it with me. Accountability!

11
00:01:03.321 --> 00:01:06.754
Motivate. Say it with me. Motivate!

12
00:01:10.277 --> 00:01:13.610
Vision. Say it with me. Vision!

13
00:01:17.109 --> 00:01:28.162
Grammar time! A good leader + verb. Listen. A good leader motivates the team. A good leader takes accountability.

14
00:01:28.212 --> 00:01:35.877
Your turn. Say it with me. A good leader motivates the team. A good leader takes accountability.

15
00:01:40.970 --> 00:01:55.720
Strong leadership isn't about doing everything alone — it's about knowing how to collaborate and delegate effectively within a team. A good leader takes initiative, motivates others toward a shared vision, and holds themselves accountable for the team's results.

16
00:01:55.770 --> 00:01:57.032
I like this story!

17
00:01:57.909 --> 00:02:03.239
Look! What's the word?

18
00:02:03.289 --> 00:02:04.501
Collaborate!

19
00:02:05.509 --> 00:02:10.870
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:10.920 --> 00:02:12.070
Motivate!

21
00:02:13.100 --> 00:02:21.896
Think and answer. What quality do you think makes someone a good leader?

22
00:02:21.946 --> 00:02:23.096
Great answer!

23
00:02:24.131 --> 00:02:26.787
This unit's value is Leadership.

24
00:02:26.837 --> 00:02:28.659
I can show leadership every day!

25
00:02:29.350 --> 00:02:40.287
Congratulations, everyone! You finished B two, the last level of C2-EPE Primary English. I am so proud of you. Bye-bye!

